graph-nl
    title Job State Machine - Sentinel

    [*] --> QUEUED: Job Submitted & Enqueued
    QUEUED --> RUNNING: Worker Claims Job
    RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED: Task Execution Success
    RUNNING --> RETRY_WAIT: Transient Failure (Retries Remaining)
    RUNNING --> FAILED: Permanent Failure or Retries Exhausted
    RETRY_WAIT --> QUEUED: Backoff Elapsed & Re-enqueued
    SUCCEEDED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
